Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.44,0:00:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.84,0:00:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,North latitude 28 degrees 24 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.74,0:00:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,West longitude 80 degrees 36 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Go there, and wait patiently\Nfor the next new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That, my friend, is when heaven will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no further use for this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The child that was born is\Nalready in my possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the story of Jailhouse Locke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.26,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Try as you might, you can only\Nremember three things at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.90,0:00:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I need something, but what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's important?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's something I cannot forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something important to tell\NJolene. I gotta go. She needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.42,0:00:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.94,0:01:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,something...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.80,0:01:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he go into that building?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand this show!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let it play!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.36,0:01:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you always have to keep\Non doing what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the remote from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.82,0:01:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what the\Nfuck is happening anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And drag her dumb ass out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.68,0:01:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I won't watch it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You happy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, newbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.84,0:01:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That there spider's the boss of this cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, good to meet you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope we can get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They call me Ron the Viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, yeah, of course. Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And that spider over there\Nis on the brink of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.82,0:01:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, sup, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell is any of\Nthis supposed to be funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, this comic book is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.80,0:01:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.66,0:01:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I? The rec room?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.38,0:02:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have had a good\Nreason to come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I have to go see Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to find another way to\Nbreak out of this place, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the medical wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio's room is off that staircase.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's usually a walk in the park,\Nbut they beefed up security today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So how do I get to Emporio in one piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit! It's a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know I've seen it before! The enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to go after it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And that woman's the user!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.62,0:03:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to move on and\Nmove on. The way I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To turn around. The trap\Nand hate will be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? Alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.08,0:03:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No survival day. Get away from.\NGo, go, go. I don't wanna fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.10,0:03:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, go 1, 2, 3. Come\Nand find a way. Rise for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:03:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.41,0:03:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.08,0:05:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And who was I chasing after just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.44,0:05:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening? I got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.30,0:05:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at the corner of hallway D12.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You, hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the one being\Nchased right now is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, here she comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.48,0:05:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn there were\Ntwo guards there a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.06,0:05:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, how did I even get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.86,0:05:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they all after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I saw her head that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Go move your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.43,0:06:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way she just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.78,0:06:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gotta be hiding somewhere close by!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she ran toward the stairwell!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She would've had to pass right\Nby us, we'd have seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The stairwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go see Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's coming back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the stairs that\Nlead to Emporio's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.98,0:06:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I doing just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I spilled the water\Nand it went everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I need to tell, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get to her before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:07:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have to write somewhere\Nelse before I forget it all again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to make sure she sees the mugshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.86,0:07:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else I won't be able to tell her...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.02,0:07:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,tell her that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Kujo, since you can only\Nretain up to three memories at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,even if there are four\Nguards chasing after you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll only be able to\Nremember three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, your eyes will be able to see\Nall of them, totaling more than four,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but your brain will outright\Nreject them as a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.74,0:07:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Go see Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.24,0:07:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I made you guide me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd have thought I'd find a secret room?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:08:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, when did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I just showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.86,0:08:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor you, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.76,0:08:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is this because you can\Nonly remember three things, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My arms have the exact same writing\Non them, ever since being in solitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.02,0:08:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to talk to you, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.44,0:08:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something really\Nimportant I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me? Uh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, what was I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get here, Jolene?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And why? Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.90,0:08:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, why, why, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.84,0:08:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to see you, and it's urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have no idea why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I just knew that if I didn't\Ncome, I'd be up Schitt's Creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Print it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I've got to print it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And fast, or else I'm\Ngoing to forget it forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.54,0:08:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only way I can save it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Print what out, Emporio?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean when\Nyou say print it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I, um, what was...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:08:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,was it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Name, Miu Miu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Rank, Chief Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.96,0:09:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So last time we met, that little\Nrat was there with you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He saw my face and my\Nstand, and he heard my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.56,0:09:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That Emporio was inside the\Nwall in the solitary cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.74,0:09:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually, I'd leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My jailhouse lock's duty is to\Nspot who the stand users are,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,track them down, and make\Nsure they're locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But if there's any\Nevidence of me out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.72,0:09:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's another story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand down, you jailbreaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Her stand, Stone Ocean, is too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.30,0:09:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So these bullets will\Nbe useless against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know you won't remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That if I had shot four bullets at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.64,0:09:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you would have no clue\Nwhere the last bullet went.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd piss your pants not knowing\Nwhether it hit you or missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't even be able to see or smell\None wisp of smoke from the gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.94,0:10:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,J-Jolene...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why there's a room\Nnor why there's a kid here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole thing sure\Nsmells suspicious as fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Although Palesnake mentions somebody\Nin here is in cahoots with Jolene,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,scheming and coordinating elaborate escape
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.52,0:10:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,plans with walkie-talkies\Nand other technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.60,0:10:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have been talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.88,0:10:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And now all the data he collected is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.64,0:10:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You rotten bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.30,0:10:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, such passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad, after these next three things,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,even those fervent emotions will be\Nas lost as your chance at freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the beauty of\Nwhat Jailhouse Lock does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat shit, Cujoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.22,0:10:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of this hail of bullets, you're\Nonly gonna be aware of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest will pierce your\Nbody like knives into butter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can try to fuck with my head all\Nyou want, but the reflection won't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how many shots you fire at once,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna see every single\None of them in the blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure you haven't\Nforgotten anything, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late. I've already\Ndestroyed the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My only choice is to bail out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene's gonna forget me in\Nabout two seconds anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.30,0:11:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be forgotten forever,\Nnot even a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio, try to hang on a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.88,0:11:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going after that bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you should, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We both know you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you're gonna forget again the\Nminute you leave this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're even gonna forget that\Nyou'll have to defeat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:11:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So please...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand you wanting to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.82,0:12:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I like that about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How else were you gonna survive\Nthis shit-bucket prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You needed to be that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.28,0:12:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.58,0:12:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,eventually it's going to\Nget to the point where
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to make a move\Neven if it's risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've got to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,For me, that time is now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this Jolene's thread?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.06,0:12:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd this happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.04,0:12:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,eventually it's going to\Nget to the point where
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to make a move\Neven if it's risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.24,0:12:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know I'm supposed to do\Nsomething really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:12:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to print it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I need to tell Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll print it out and…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But what was it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What was the thing I'm supposed to print?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.13,0:13:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even have a printer\Nin my room, so how can I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, she's the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.38,0:13:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not gonna get\Naway from me this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.66,0:13:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, I need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at the stairs at D-10!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.56,0:13:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're right over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.60,0:13:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Beauty was being attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.90,0:13:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate, open it! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.72,0:14:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, where am I? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.22,0:14:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab her before she escapes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.56,0:14:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They're chasing someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.24,0:14:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, I called\Nthe three guards back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now any and all memories you had of me\Nare lost forever, just like your freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.22,0:14:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up and run a bit, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll give them more of a reason\Nto put a bullet in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, those big, strong arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I nearly forgot they can\Ndeflect any shots at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My official sworn duty is really only\Nto make sure stand users get put away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.22,0:15:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm rather excited you're\Ngetting more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.98,0:15:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing you're about\Nto die makes me giddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.04,0:15:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone deserves it, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all because you refuse to\Nbehave and be a good little doggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.42,0:15:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I got her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, also, the fact that you can only\Nsee three guards in front of you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.46,0:15:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,is driving me wild with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're never getting past my jailhouse\Nlock, so you might as well stop fighting it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you. You're Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Jolene, you gotta know,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.16,0:15:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,this needs to be printed out or else\NI was gonna forget it in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.06,0:15:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Print what out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.50,0:15:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in binary code.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The language only uses ones and zeros.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I calculated it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.32,0:15:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be able to print it out how\Nyou'd be able to understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is, you're the\Nprinter who can memorize it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,binary is universal all\Nthings can be represented
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.08,0:16:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,with numeric sequencing\Nif your thread can draw
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the ones and zeros exactly\Nright then stone ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,will become the printer\Nthat'll express it digitally
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.16,0:16:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I consider you to be the\Nenemy? Well, are you my enemy? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.76,0:16:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, say your last goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.64,0:16:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You just confirmed it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.38,0:16:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:16:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell am I seeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That psycho took Chief Miu Miu hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.00,0:17:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Emporio, I disabled Jailhouse\NLock's hold on you and me. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.68,0:17:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'm okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.94,0:17:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.85,0:17:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said before, I'm\Nbreaking out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.24,0:17:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you insist on staying in this hole,\Nyou'd better get back to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.12,0:17:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene, I just\Nrealized now's my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.98,0:17:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's a kid with her now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a kid in this prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.90,0:17:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus men, don't let your guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Emporio, you ready? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.36,0:17:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, you're in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please step aside, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.30,0:18:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.21,0:18:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I aiming at, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why am I in the hallway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.00,0:18:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How did we all get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Miu Miu. Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.26,0:18:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You catch on quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost like you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.36,0:18:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna head straight\Nto the medical way
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to treat the injuries\Nyou caused to Emporium
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm still counting on\Nyour magic jailhouse lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on that invincible\Npower the power of three
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.88,0:18:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.18,0:18:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You have dad's disc, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've had it the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene! That you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, it is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And Emporio too! Hey, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize the sound of that chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it had to be you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the carcass?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.24,0:19:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, she's the chief\Nguard of this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.79,0:19:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys saying you're about to...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.62,0:19:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's a prison break.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.64,0:19:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're about to leave any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.90,0:19:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going after the priest, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Ermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever that thing was he got his\Nhands on, I'm gonna go seal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing this thing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been more resolved than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I think you gotta take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.78,0:20:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.70,0:20:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How fortunate you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to ask, but are you unwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.35,0:20:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a bit fatigued, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.76,0:21:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with these eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.22,0:21:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't the vaguest idea what it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.88,0:21:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's painfully clear that\Nit's no longer Pale Snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.62,0:21:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.66,0:21:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.24,0:21:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.60,0:21:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is quickly raging\Nout of control inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.28,0:21:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's some kind of independent\Npower that's ignoring my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But oddly, I feel hope in this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope, in fact, is the one and\Nonly thing I feel from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.86,0:21:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio's note recorded in Jotaro's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps that is what I need\Nto control this power, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The time and place, north\Nlatitude 28 degrees, 24 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.80,0:21:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,west longitude 80 degrees, 36 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.66,0:21:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven appears to be there after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And that place is at Cape Canaveral,\NKennedy Space Center to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.46,0:22:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The time is the new\Nmoon, six days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.76,0:22:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place other than here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.50,0:22:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.68,0:22:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.04,0:23:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering About my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.96,0:23:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,About all
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.26,0:23:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the things I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.16,0:23:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,like to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.72,0:23:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.54,0:23:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,dreamer A
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.82,0:23:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,distant dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From today
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.32,0:23:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.36,0:24:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
